flowchart LR
  subgraph Public[Public trust boundary]
    Patient[Patient browser]
  end
  subgraph Staff[Authenticated staff boundary]
    Reception[Reception browser]
    Manager[Manager browser]
  end
  subgraph QuickClinic[QuickClinic deployment]
    Web[Next.js responsive web]
    API[NestJS modular-monolith API]
    DB[(PostgreSQL scheduling data)]
    Queue[(Redis notification queue)]
    Worker[Email worker]
  end
  Email[Transactional email provider]

  Patient -->|HTTPS| Web
  Reception -->|HTTPS + reception role| Web
  Manager -->|HTTPS + manager role| Web
  Web -->|REST JSON + authenticated session| API
  API -->|transactions and slot locks| DB
  API -->|committed outbox job| Queue
  Queue --> Worker
  Worker -->|idempotent HTTPS request| Email
  Worker -->|delivery state| DB
